  "title": "Functional equivalents can be unconscious",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "8c5ecdcb-8fff-424c-9663-cf6fff83a2a7",
      "text": "Any behavior of a recurrent conscious system can be performed by a feed-forward system, so there can be unconscious systems that are functionally equivalent to conscious ones. Systems can be equivalent in what they do and differ in what they are.",
